TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution question
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn 1
RATES
Calcite_custom
-start
10 rem specific surface area = PARM(1)
20 rem rate constant = PARM(2)
30 rate = PARM(1) * PARM(2)
40 moles = rate * TIME
50 if (moles > M) then moles = M
60 SAVE moles
-end
KINETICS 1
Calcite_custom
    -formula CaCO3 1
    -m0 1
    -m 1
    -parms 10.0 0.001
    -steps 1000 in 100 steps
END
